{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】本港地區今日(10月25日)天氣預測，天晴乾燥。日間市區最高氣溫約31度，新界再高一兩度。吹和緩北至東北風。</p>\n<p>展望明日大致天晴。隨後一兩日風勢較大，雲量逐漸增多。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T23:40:16.393854+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T23:30:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:38:10.379878+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T23:38:10.379878+00:00","content_hash":"0ce949ee4fb0f00bdece21bb83d1e2d8f12cfcd63fb210974d9f027f40a48b9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}